# Uptime alerts

Two checks only, as recorded in REQUESTS.md.

- HTTPS: CloudWatch Synthetics canary for the registration portal, every 3 minutes.
- TCP: Lambda on EventBridge for PRD.given.co.il port 7080, every 3 minutes. It records a metric. It does not send mail itself.
- Both alarms notify one SNS email topic after the configured number of consecutive failures.

Do not add components, channels, a dashboard, or a status page unless REQUESTS.md changes.

Do not commit email addresses, phone numbers, access keys, or `terraform.tfvars`. Recipient lists belong only in that local file.

The user is technical but not a developer. Reply in Hebrew, in plain language. Do not show code unless they ask.
